{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 🔍 RAG Document Q&A — Step-by-Step Exploration\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook walks through the entire RAG pipeline manually so you can understand each step:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **PDF Ingestion** — Extract text with PyMuPDF\n",
    "2. **Text Chunking** — Split into overlapping chunks\n",
    "3. **Embedding** — Convert chunks to vectors with Voyage\n",
    "4. **FAISS Storage** — Store and index vectors locally\n",
    "5. **Retrieval** — Find the most relevant chunks for a query\n",
    "6. **Generation** — Use Claude to answer based on retrieved context\n",
    "\n",
    "**Author:** Olusegun (Victor) Makanju | github.com/VictorM21"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Setup — run this first\n",
    "import os, sys\n",
    "sys.path.append('..')  # Add project root to path\n",
    "\n",
    "from dotenv import load_dotenv\n",
    "load_dotenv('../.env')\n",
    "\n",
    "ANTHROPIC_API_KEY = os.getenv('ANTHROPIC_API_KEY')\n",
    "assert ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, 'Set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY in your .env file!'\n",
    "print('✅ API key loaded successfully')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## Step 1: PDF Ingestion with PyMuPDF"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import fitz  # PyMuPDF\n",
    "\n",
    "PDF_PATH = '../data/raw/your_document.pdf'  # Change this!\n",
    "\n",
    "doc = fitz.open(PDF_PATH)\n",
    "print(f'Pages: {len(doc)}')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Extract text from all pages\n",
    "full_text = ''\n",
    "for page_num, page in enumerate(doc):\n",
    "    text = page.get_text()\n",
    "    full_text += text\n",
    "    print(f'Page {page_num + 1}: {len(text)} characters')\n",
    "\n",
    "doc.close()\n",
    "print(f'\\nTotal: {len(full_text):,} characters')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## Step 2: Text Chunking"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from langchain.text_splitter import RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter\n",
    "\n",
    "splitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(\n",
    "    chunk_size=1000,\n",
    "    chunk_overlap=200,\n",
    "    separators=['\\n\\n', '\\n', '. ', ' ', ''],\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "chunks = splitter.split_text(full_text)\n",
    "print(f'Created {len(chunks)} chunks')\n",
    "print(f'Average chunk size: {sum(len(c) for c in chunks) // len(chunks)} chars')\n",
    "print(f'\\nFirst chunk preview:\\n{chunks[0][:300]}...')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## Step 3: Embedding with Anthropic Voyage"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from langchain_anthropic import AnthropicEmbeddings\n",
    "\n",
    "embeddings = AnthropicEmbeddings(\n",
    "    model='voyage-3',\n",
    "    anthropic_api_key=ANTHROPIC_API_KEY,\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Embed a single chunk to test\n",
    "test_vector = embeddings.embed_query(chunks[0])\n",
    "print(f'Embedding dimensions: {len(test_vector)}')\n",
    "print(f'First 5 values: {test_vector[:5]}')\n",
    "print('✅ Embeddings working!')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## Step 4: FAISS Vector Store"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from langchain_community.vectorstores import FAISS\n",
    "from langchain.schema import Document\n",
    "\n",
    "# Create Document objects with metadata\n",
    "documents = [\n",
    "    Document(page_content=chunk, metadata={'source': PDF_PATH, 'chunk_index': i})\n",
    "    for i, chunk in enumerate(chunks)\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'Building FAISS index from {len(documents)} chunks...')\n",
    "vectorstore = FAISS.from_documents(documents, embeddings)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Save to disk\n",
    "vectorstore.save_local('../data/vectorstore')\n",
    "print('✅ FAISS index created and saved!')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## Step 5: Retrieval — Finding Relevant Chunks"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "QUERY = 'What are the main findings?'  # Change to your question\n",
    "\n",
    "retrieved_docs = vectorstore.similarity_search(QUERY, k=3)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'Query: {QUERY}')\n",
    "print(f'Retrieved {len(retrieved_docs)} chunks:\\n')\n",
    "for i, doc in enumerate(retrieved_docs):\n",
    "    print(f'--- Chunk {i+1} (source: {doc.metadata["source"]}) ---')\n",
    "    print(doc.page_content[:200])\n",
    "    print()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## Step 6: Generation — Claude Answers Your Question"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from langchain_anthropic import ChatAnthropic\n",
    "from langchain_core.prompts import ChatPromptTemplate\n",
    "from langchain_core.output_parsers import StrOutputParser\n",
    "from langchain_core.runnables import RunnablePassthrough\n",
    "\n",
    "# Build context from retrieved chunks\n",
    "context = '\\n\\n---\\n\\n'.join(doc.page_content for doc in retrieved_docs)\n",
    "\n",
    "llm = ChatAnthropic(\n",
    "    model='claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022',\n",
    "    anthropic_api_key=ANTHROPIC_API_KEY,\n",
    "    temperature=0.1,\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "prompt = ChatPromptTemplate.from_messages([\n",
    "    ('system', 'Answer the question using ONLY the context below.\\n\\nContext:\\n{context}'),\n",
    "    ('human', '{question}'),\n",
    "])\n",
    "\n",
    "chain = prompt | llm | StrOutputParser()\n",
    "\n",
    "answer = chain.invoke({'context': context, 'question': QUERY})\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'Q: {QUERY}')\n",
    "print(f'\\nA: {answer}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
Add RAG exploration notebook: 6-step walkthrough from PDF to Claude answer   "source": [
